            "text": "<p>GrassCrafts brings you handwoven storage baskets, tote bags, planters, wall plates, table mats and gift hampers made by Indian artisans from natural grasses and fibres. Shop Madurkathi mats from Medinipur, Kauna grass from Manipur, Sabai grass, Sitalpati, cane, bamboo, jute and water hyacinth, with free shipping across India on orders of ₹1,299 and above, and bulk orders for corporate gifting and weddings.</p>"
